dad con alimentaci\u00f3n ininterrumpida, algoritmo de control antica\u00edda y cuerda de seguridad superresistente.<\/li><li><b>4 CLEAN MODES:&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>4 programas de limpieza autom\u00e1ticos para limpiar tu ventana desde cualquier posici\u00f3n.<\/li><li><b>ADVANCE CLEAN 3:&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>Gracias a su tecnolog\u00eda inteligente pulveriza, limpia y seca de forma aut\u00f3noma durante su funci\u00f3n<\/li><li><b>AUTOSTOP SYSTEM<\/b>: indica y para de forma autom\u00e1tica cuando acaba su funci\u00f3n.<\/li><\/ul><h2><span style='background-color: initial;'>Composici\u00f3n<\/span><\/h2><ul><li>1 cuerda de seguridad<\/li><li>12 pa\u00f1os de microfibra reutilizables,<\/li><li>5 metros de conexi\u00f3n a la red el\u00e9ctrica<\/li><li>Cable 5<\/li><li>Mando de control teledirigido<\/li><li>Manual App<\/li><li>Manual de instrucciones<\/li><li>Conga Windroid 890 SprayWater Smart Connected<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><br><p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"CECOTEC","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":117.69,"unit_price_tax":117.69,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Limpieza de Hogar","sub_category":"Robot Limpiacristales","quantity":0,"brand":"CECOTEC","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_cec-robot%20conga%20windr%20890_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":112.69}}},"4892210211415":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["4892210211415",false],"wholesale_price":[172.56,false],"price":[177.56,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product w