onector<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>USB alimentaci\u00f3n + Jack 3.5mm audio<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Drivers<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>2 Activos<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Rango de frecuencia<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>20Hz-20KHz<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Impedancia<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>4&#937;<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Control de volumen<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>S\u00ed<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Voltaje<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>DC 5V<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Corriente<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>1A<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Longitud del cable<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>150cm<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Compatibilidad<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>PC\/Mac\/Smartphone\/Tablet<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Versi\u00f3n Bluetooth<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>5.0<\/span><\/li><li><span style='font-weight: 700; background-color: initial;'>Distancia de conexi\u00f3n<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>10m<\/span><\/li><\/ul><br><\/p>                                                                                        ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":""