WIFI Wi-Fi 5. 802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac. 2.4GHz y 5GHz<\/li>  <li>BLUETOOTH 5.0<\/li>  <li>DUAL SIM &#10004; NanoSIM<\/li>  <li>GPS &#10004;<\/li>  <li>A-GPS &#10004;<\/li>  <li>RADIO FM &#10004;<\/li>  <li>SALIDA DE AUDIO &#10004;<\/li>  <li>NFC &#10004;<\/li>  <li><b>PANTALLA<\/b><\/li>  <li>TAMA\u00d1O 6.5&#8217;&#8217;<\/li>  <li>RELACI\u00d3N DE ASPECTO 20:9<\/li>  <li>TIPO Tecnolog\u00eda IPS InCell, protecci\u00f3n Panda<\/li>  <li>COLOR 16,7 millones<\/li>  <li>RESOLUCI\u00d3N HD+ 1600x720, densidad de p\u00edxeles: 269 PPI<\/li>  <li>MULTIT\u00c1CTIL &#10004;<\/li>  <li>ACELER\u00d3METRO &#10004;<\/li>  <li><b>C\u00c1MARAS<\/b><\/li>  <li>C\u00c1MARA TRASERA 13Mpx + 2Mpx (Macro)<\/li>  <li>C\u00c1MARA FRONTAL 5Mpx<\/li>  <li>FLASH &#10004;<\/li>  <li>GRABACI\u00d3N DE V\u00cdDEO 1080p@30fps<\/li>  <li><b>ALMACENAMIENTO<\/b><\/li>  <li>MEMORIA RAM 3GB<\/li>  <li>MEMORIA INTERNA 64GB  <\/li><li>MEMORIA AMPLIABLE Hasta 256GB<\/li>  <li><b>BATER\u00cdA Y CARGA<\/b><\/li>  <li>BATER\u00cdA 4.500mAh<\/li>  <li>CONEXI\u00d3N USB USB-C<\/li>  <li>USB OTG &#10004;<\/li>  <li><b>CARACTER\u00cdSTICAS GENERALES<\/b><\/li>  <li>DESBLOQUEO POR HUELLA &#10004;<\/li>  <li>DESBLOQUEO FACIAL &#10004;<\/li>  <li>BOT\u00d3N INTELIGENTE Configurable. Por defecto Google Assistant.<\/li>  <li>GOOGLE MOBILE SERVICES &#10004;<\/li>  <li><b>DIMENSIONES Y PESO<\/b><\/li>  <li>ALTO 164,8 mm<\/li>  <li>ANCHO 75,8 mm<\/li>  <li>FONDO 9,2 mm<\/li>  <li>PESO 202 g<\/li>  <li><b>CONTENIDO DE LA CAJA<\/b><\/li>  <li>Smartphone. Manual de usuario. Cable USB.<\/li><\/ul><\/p>                                                                                        ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"SPC","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":